From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amphion <dev@amphion.local>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 14:45:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] build(harmony): build HAR native libs for arm64 only
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The Amphion Harmony delivery only packages arm64-v8a native libraries.
Keeping x86_64 in the sherpa_onnx HAR abiFilters makes hvigor try to link
libsherpa-onnx-c-api.so for x86_64, which is not produced by the delivery
scripts and breaks reproducible command-line builds.

---
 harmony-os/SherpaOnnxHar/sherpa_onnx/build-profile.json5 | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/harmony-os/SherpaOnnxHar/sherpa_onnx/build-profile.json5 b/harmony-os/SherpaOnnxHar/sherpa_onnx/build-profile.json5
index 905c5712..be1a7eca 100644
--- a/harmony-os/SherpaOnnxHar/sherpa_onnx/build-profile.json5
+++ b/harmony-os/SherpaOnnxHar/sherpa_onnx/build-profile.json5
@@ -7,7 +7,6 @@
       "cppFlags": "-std=c++17",
       "abiFilters": [
         "arm64-v8a",
-        "x86_64",
       ],
     },
   },
-- 
2.39.5

